     {
      "text": "I pulled the plant's daily consumption for April 2026, split into tariff bands F1, F2 and F3, from the site meter. The full result has 78 rows, but only the first 50 came back to me, so I can only describe 1 to 20 April here. The rows for 21 to 30 April are in the full result, but I haven't seen them.\n\n**Weekdays (Mon to Fri):** all three bands show up every day.\n- **F1:** about 15,800\u201316,650 kWh a day, roughly 57\u201360% of the day's total.\n- **F2:** about 6,000\u20136,600 kWh.\n- **F3:** usually about 5,350\u20135,700 kWh.\n- **Daily total:** usually around 28,000\u201328,600 kWh.\n- **Mondays (6 and 13 April):** F3 was lower, at about 3,500 kWh. That's probably because the early hours of Monday follow a quiet Sunday night. The daily total was about 25,900\u201326,050 kWh.\n\n**Saturdays (4, 11 and 18 April):** there's no F1 at all, only F2 and F3.\n- **F2:** about 8,300\u20139,100 kWh.\n- **F3:** about 4,400\u20135,000 kWh.\n- **Daily total:** about 13,000\u201314,100 kWh, around half a weekday.\n\n**Sundays (5, 12 and 19 April):** everything is billed as F3, about 6,275 kWh each day.\n\n**Selected days (kWh):**\n\n| Day | F1 | F2 | F3 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Wed 1 Apr | 16,266 | 6,301 | 5,521 |\n| Fri 3 Apr | 16,045 | 6,143 | 5,348 |\n| Sat 4 Apr | \u2014 | 8,344 | 4,643 |\n| Sun 5 Apr | \u2014 | \u2014 | 6,275 |\n| Mon 6 Apr | 16,049 | 6,493 | 3,511 |\n| Wed 15 Apr | 16,644 | 6,532 | 5,473 |\n| Sat 18 Apr | \u2014 | 8,789 | 4,444 |\n| Sun 19 Apr | \u2014 | \u2014 | 6,278 |\n| Mon 20 Apr | 16,277 | 6,160 | (not in the rows I saw) |\n\nThe last 10 days of April probably follow the same weekday and weekend pattern, but I can't confirm that or give their figures without the missing rows.",
